<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Hi <%= recipientName %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">We couldn't complete the <%= actionLabel %> of the real-time trigger for <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= objectApiName %></strong> on the <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= crmName %></strong> org, as part of your backup configuration <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= backupConfigName %></strong>.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Object</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= objectApiName %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Objects in this config</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= totalObjectCount %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Configuration created</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;"><%= configCreatedAt %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:14px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#b91c1c;background-color:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:8px;"><%= errorMessage %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<% if (needsRecoveryRecordId) { %>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;">To retry, please provide a sample record Id for <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= objectApiName %></strong> so we can complete the setup.</p>
<% } else { %>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;">Please retry from your dashboard, or reach out if this keeps happening.</p>
<% } %>
